<title>UK: Jarvis Hotels H1 pretax profit 13.9 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Jarvis Hotels H1 pretax profit 13.9 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty eight weeks to October 12</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		7.9		    vs 6.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.0		    vs nil</p>
<p> Turnover		   61.75		  vs 52.97</p>
<p>Pretax profit	    13.87		  vs 11.14</p>
<p>Operating profit	 16.16		  vs 12.43</p>
<p> Exceptional		5.8		    vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Jarvis Hotels Plc was listed on the London stock exchange at the end of June. It said the figures are presented on a pro forma basis.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
